                  <TextArea fx:id="DataScie1" editable="false" prefHeight="654.0" prefWidth="806.0" text="1. Data Analyst&#10;&#10;Upcoming Future: &#10;The demand for data analysts will grow as businesses rely on data to drive &#10;decision-making. With advancements in AI and analytics tools, their role will &#10;become more sophisticated, focusing on real-time insights and predictive analysis.&#10; The increasing use of dashboards and visualization platforms will make their work &#10;more impactful.&#10;&#10;Career Opportunity: &#10;Data analysts will find opportunities across industries like retail, healthcare, finance, &#10;and marketing. They will be essential in optimizing processes, improving customer &#10;experience, and making strategic business decisions. Certifications in tools like Power &#10;BI and Tableau will enhance job prospects.&#10;&#10;Job Sector for the Next 10 Years: &#10;The data-driven sectors of e-commerce, supply chain management, and digital &#10;marketing will see steady demand for analysts. Hybrid roles combining analytics &#10;with AI and business strategy will emerge.&#10;&#10;New Industries &amp; Businesses: &#10;Companies focused on real-time data processing, predictive analytics platforms, &#10;and AI-enabled business intelligence solutions will create new roles for analysts.">
                     <font>
                        <Font size="21.0" />
                     </font>
                     <VBox.margin>
                        <Insets left="10.0" right="10.0" />
                     </VBox.margin>
                  </TextArea>
                  <TextArea fx:id="DataScie" editable="false" prefHeight="614.0" prefWidth="806.0" text="2. Data Scientist&#10;&#10;Upcoming Future: &#10;Data science will evolve with the integration of machine learning, AI, and automation. &#10;Professionals will focus on advanced algorithms, building predictive models, and &#10;solving complex problems in real-time. AI governance and ethical AI applications &#10;will also become central.&#10;&#10;Career Opportunity: &#10;Data scientists will be in high demand in sectors like healthcare, autonomous systems, &#10;and tech startups. Expertise in Python, R, and cloud platforms like AWS will make &#10;candidates highly desirable. Roles in natural language processing (NLP) and AI ethics &#10;will expand.&#10;&#10;Job Sector for the Next 10 Years: &#10;Data science jobs will grow in areas like climate technology, renewable energy, &#10;smart cities, and AI development. Opportunities in sectors implementing AI at scale, &#10;such as insurance and manufacturing, will surge.&#10;&#10;New Industries &amp; Businesses: &#10;Startups focusing on AI-powered automation, algorithm fairness, and healthcare &#10;analytics will flourish, opening new career pathways.">
                     <font>
                        <Font size="21.0" />
                     </font>
                     <VBox.margin>
                        <Insets left="10.0" right="10.0" />
                     </VBox.margin>
                  </TextArea>
                  <TextArea fx:id="dataEng" editable="false" prefHeight="530.0" prefWidth="806.0" text="3. Data Engineer&#10;&#10;Upcoming Future: &#10;Data engineers will focus on building robust data pipelines and managing large-scale&#10; infrastructure for AI and IoT systems. The transition to cloud-native architectures and &#10;real-time data streaming will redefine the field.&#10;&#10;Career Opportunity: &#10;Cloud computing companies, fintech, and e-commerce platforms will rely heavily on &#10;data engineers to process and manage vast datasets. Advanced roles like cloud &#10;architects and big data specialists will emerge.&#10;&#10;Job Sector for the Next 10 Years: &#10;Sectors like financial services, healthcare, and logistics will require scalable data &#10;solutions. The emergence of data-sharing ecosystems will create niche job opportunities.&#10;&#10;New Industries &amp; Businesses:&#10;Businesses specializing in cloud-based data engineering, IoT data pipelines, and &#10;machine learning infrastructure will lead innovation in this field.">
                     <font>
                        <Font size="21.0" />
                     </font>
                     <VBox.margin>
                        <Insets left="10.0" right="10.0" />
                     </VBox.margin>
                  </TextArea>
                  <TextArea fx:id="cyber" editable="false" prefHeight="530.0" prefWidth="806.0" text="4. Cybersecurity Professional&#10;&#10;Upcoming Future: &#10;With rising cyber threats, cybersecurity professionals will be essential for &#10;safeguarding critical infrastructure, sensitive data, and digital identities.&#10; AI-based threat detection and quantum encryption will revolutionize security measures&#10;.&#10;Career Opportunity: &#10;High demand for roles like penetration testers, cybersecurity analysts, and cloud &#10;security specialists. Industries like finance, healthcare, and government &#10;will invest heavily in cybersecurity.&#10;&#10;Job Sector for the Next 10 Years: &#10;As businesses digitize, sectors like IoT, blockchain, and cloud computing will require&#10;specialized security solutions. Cybersecurity-as-a-service will become booming industry.&#10;&#10;New Industries &amp; Businesses: &#10;Companies offering AI-driven threat intelligence, blockchain security, and&#10;advanced cryptographic services will open exciting career options.">
                     <font>
                        <Font size="21.0" />
                     </font>
                     <VBox.margin>
                        <Insets left="10.0" right="10.0" />
                     </VBox.margin>
                  </TextArea>
                  <TextArea fx:id="UiDesign" editable="false" prefHeight="525.0" prefWidth="806.0" text="5. UX Designer&#10;&#10;Upcoming Future: &#10;The UX field will expand with a focus on AR/VR design, voice interfaces, and &#10;accessibility for diverse users. Personalization and inclusivity will shape design trends.&#10;&#10;Career Opportunity: &#10;UX designers will be in demand across gaming, SaaS platforms, healthcare, and &#10;IoT applications. Expertise in prototyping tools like Figma &#10;and AR/VR design frameworks will boost job prospects.&#10;&#10;Job Sector for the Next 10 Years: &#10;Smart devices, wearable tech, and virtual reality platforms will create a need for &#10;intuitive and immersive user experiences.&#10;&#10;New Industries &amp; Businesses: &#10;Companies focusing on voice UX, neurodiverse accessibility solutions, and AR/VR &#10;apps for education and entertainment will drive innovation in the field.">
                     <font>
                        <Font size="21.0" />
                     </font>
                     <VBox.margin>
                        <Insets left="10.0" right="10.0" />
                     </VBox.margin>
                  </TextArea>
                  <TextArea fx:id="itSpecialist" editable="false" prefHeight="525.0" prefWidth="806.0" text="6. IT Support Specialist&#10;&#10;Upcoming Future: IT support will evolve to include AI-assisted troubleshooting, &#10;automation, and managing hybrid work environments. &#10;Expertise in cloud services and cybersecurity will be vital.&#10;&#10;Career Opportunity: &#10;Opportunities will grow in sectors relying on SaaS platforms, remote work tools &#10;and cloud infrastructure. Certifications in platforms like AWS and &#10;Microsoft Azure will be highly valuable.&#10;&#10;Job Sector for the Next 10 Years: &#10;Demand will surge in IoT support, managed IT services, and enterprise software &#10;troubleshooting. Cybersecurity-focused IT support will be in high demand.&#10;&#10;New Industries &amp; Businesses: &#10;Startups providing AI-driven IT services, remote management solutions, &#10;and cybersecurity support for SMEs will grow.">
                     <font>
                        <Font size="21.0" />
                     </font>
                     <VBox.margin>
                        <Insets left="10.0" right="10.0" />
                     </VBox.margin>
                  </TextArea>
                  <TextArea fx:id="appDeveloper" editable="false" prefHeight="525.0" prefWidth="806.0" text="7. Application Developer&#10;&#10;Upcoming Future: &#10;The focus for application developers will shift toward creating cross-platform, &#10;AI-integrated, and cloud-native apps. AR/VR and wearable tech &#10;apps will drive future innovations.&#10;&#10;Career Opportunity: &#10;Developers will find opportunities in health tech, gaming, and productivity tools. &#10;Skills in React Native, Flutter, and cloud platforms will enhance employability.&#10;&#10;Job Sector for the Next 10 Years: &#10;The SaaS and mobile-first ecosystems will create sustained demand for developers&#10; specializing in scalable app development.&#10;&#10;New Industries &amp; Businesses:&#10;Startups focusing on gamification, AI-driven mobile apps, and wearable-compatible&#10; applications will shape the industry.">
                     <font>
                        <Font size="21.0" />
                     </font>
                     <VBox.margin>
                        <Insets left="10.0" right="10.0" />
                     </VBox.margin>
                  </TextArea>
                  <TextArea fx:id="BackEndDeveloper" editable="false" prefHeight="525.0" prefWidth="806.0" text="8. Back-End Developer&#10;&#10;Upcoming Future: &#10;Back-end developers will focus on microservices, serverless computing, &#10;and high-performance APIs to power modern applications. &#10;Emphasis on security and scalability will grow.&#10;&#10;Career Opportunity: &#10;E-commerce, cloud-native services, and SaaS platforms will seek professionals with &#10;expertise in database management and scalable system design.&#10;&#10;Job Sector for the Next 10 Years:&#10;Sectors like fintech, blockchain, and AI-powered platforms will demand skilled&#10;back-end developers.&#10;&#10;New Industries &amp; Businesses:&#10;Companies building decentralized systems, blockchain solutions, and &#10;real-time analytics will flourish.">
                     <font>
                        <Font size="21.0" />
                     </font>
                     <VBox.margin>
                        <Insets left="10.0" right="10.0" />
                     </VBox.margin>
                  </TextArea>
                  <TextArea fx:id="DevOpsEngineer" prefHeight="500.0" prefWidth="806.0" text="9. DevOps Engineer&#10;&#10;Upcoming Future: &#10;DevOps engineers will adopt AI tools to automate workflows, enhance CI/CD pipelines,&#10; and manage cloud-native applications. DevSecOps will gain prominence.&#10;&#10;Career Opportunity: &#10;Strong demand in industries focusing on cloud computing, edge computing, and &#10;real-time deployment. Certifications in Kubernetes and Docker will add value.&#10;&#10;Job Sector for the Next 10 Years: &#10;Edge computing and AI-powered deployment automation will be key growth areas. &#10;Hybrid cloud platforms will dominate.&#10;&#10;New Industries &amp; Businesses: &#10;Startups offering advanced DevOps automation and security solutions will create diverse&#10;roles.">
                     <font>
                        <Font size="21.0" />
                     </font>
                     <VBox.margin>
                        <Insets left="10.0" right="10.0" />
                     </VBox.margin>
                  </TextArea>
                  <TextArea fx:id="blockchain" prefHeight="500.0" prefWidth="806.0" text="10. Blockchain Developer&#10;&#10;Upcoming Future: &#10;Blockchain will evolve beyond cryptocurrency, powering smart contracts, &#10;decentralized finance (DeFi), and secure digital identities. &#10;Innovations like Web3 will drive demand.&#10;&#10;Career Opportunity: &#10;Opportunities will grow in fintech, supply chain management, and tokenized asset &#10;platforms. Developers with expertise in Solidity and Hyperledger will excel.&#10;&#10;Job Sector for the Next 10 Years: &#10;Blockchain applications in gaming, healthcare, and legal tech will expand. &#10;Decentralized apps (dApps) will be a major focus.&#10;&#10;New Industries &amp; Businesses: &#10;Companies specializing in NFT marketplaces, DeFi platforms, and blockchain-based &#10;authentication solutions will emerge.">
                     <font>
                        <Font size="21.0" />
                     </font>
                     <VBox.margin>
                        <Insets left="10.0" right="10.0" />
                     </VBox.margin>
                  </TextArea>
                  <TextArea fx:id="DigitalMarketer" prefHeight="513.0" prefWidth="806.0" text="11. Digital Marketer&#10;&#10;Upcoming Future: &#10;AI and data analytics will transform digital marketing, focusing on hyper-personalized &#10;campaigns and omnichannel strategies. The metaverse will create new marketing &#10;channels.&#10;&#10;Career Opportunity: &#10;Demand for professionals skilled in SEO, social media marketing, and content strategy &#10;will grow. Expertise in AI-driven tools and analytics will be essential.&#10;&#10;Job Sector for the Next 10 Years: &#10;Metaverse advertising, influencer-driven marketing, and voice search optimization will &#10;lead the field.&#10;&#10;New Industries &amp; Businesses: &#10;Companies specializing in virtual brand experiences, AI-powered ad platforms, and &#10;influencer marketplaces will grow.">
                     <font>
                        <Font size="21.0" />
                     </font>
                     <VBox.margin>
                        <Insets left="10.0" right="10.0" />
                     </VBox.margin>
                  </TextArea>
                  <TextArea fx:id="FulStackDeveloper" prefHeight="511.0" prefWidth="806.0" text="12. Full Stack Developer&#10;&#10;Upcoming Future: &#10;Full-stack developers will focus on scalable, end-to-end solutions integrating &#10;front-end, back-end, and cloud technologies. Real-time applications will dominate.&#10;&#10;Career Opportunity: &#10;Opportunities in startups, SaaS platforms, and e-commerce will grow, with strong &#10;demand for expertise in React, Node.js, and cloud services.&#10;&#10;Job Sector for the Next 10 Years: &#10;AI-powered platforms, microservices, and cloud-native apps will lead the demand for &#10;full-stack expertise.&#10;&#10;New Industries &amp; Businesses: &#10;Startups developing collaborative tools, real-time applications, and machine learning &#10;platforms will create numerous opportunities.">
                     <font>
                        <Font size="21.0" />
                     </font>
                     <VBox.margin>
                        <Insets left="10.0" right="10.0" />
                     </VBox.margin>
                  </TextArea>
                  <TextArea fx:id="FrontEndDeveloper" prefHeight="366.0" prefWidth="806.0" text="13. Front-End Developer&#10;Upcoming Future: &#10;Front-end developers will focus on creating intuitive user interfaces, incorporating AR/VR,&#10;Web3, and progressive web app frameworks.&#10;Career Opportunity: &#10;High demand in gaming, e-commerce, and Web3 platforms. Expertise in React, Angular, &#10;and interactive design will be essential.&#10;Job Sector for the Next 10 Years: &#10;Front-end roles in AR/VR, blockchain interfaces, and mobile-first platforms will grow &#10;significantly.&#10;New Industries &amp; Businesses: &#10;Companies designing immersive user experiences for metaverse and Web3 will expand.">
                     <font>
                        <Font size="21.0" />
                     </font>
                     <VBox.margin>
                        <Insets left="10.0" right="10.0" />
                     </VBox.margin>
                  </TextArea>
                  <TextArea fx:id="iosDeveloper" prefHeight="366.0" prefWidth="806.0" text="14.  iOS Developer&#10;Upcoming Future: &#10;The iOS ecosystem will continue growing, with demand for innovative apps in fitness,&#10;health, and AR applications. Wearables will integrate more closely with mobile apps.&#10;Career Opportunity:&#10; iOS developers skilled in Swift, ARKit, and app optimization will find strong &#10;opportunities in gaming, enterprise tools, and lifestyle apps.&#10;Job Sector for the Next 10 Years:&#10; Sectors like health tech, smart wearables, and AR applications will drive demand &#10;for iOS developers.&#10;New Industries &amp; Businesses: Startups focusing on subscription apps, health &#10;monitoring tools, and AR-driven experiences will thrive.&#10;">
                     <font>
                        <Font size="21.0" />
                     </font>
                     <VBox.margin>
                        <Insets left="10.0" right="10.0" />
                     </VBox.margin>
                  </TextArea>
                  <TextArea fx:id="game" editable="false" prefHeight="654.0" prefWidth="806.0" text="15. Game Development&#10;Upcoming Future:&#10;The gaming industry will grow exponentially, driven by advancements in AR, VR, and cloud &#10;gaming. The rise of Web3 and the metaverse will create new opportunities for immersive &#10;game experiences and user-generated content.&#10;&#10;Career Opportunity: &#10;Game developers will find roles in indie game studios, AAA companies, and mobile &#10;gaming. Specializations in AR/VR design, 3D modeling, and interactive storytelling &#10;will be highly valued. Tools like Unity and Unreal Engine will remain essential.&#10;&#10;Job Sector for the Next 10 Years: &#10;Cloud gaming, eSports, and VR gaming will dominate. Cross-platform gaming and &#10;blockchain-based play-to-earn models will further diversify the industry.&#10;&#10;New Industries &amp; Businesses:&#10; Startups focusing on metaverse-based gaming, educational games, and &#10;AI-driven interactive narratives will create fresh opportunities in this field.&#10;">
                     <font>
                        <Font size="21.0" />
                     </font>
                     <VBox.margin>
                        <Insets left="10.0" right="10.0" />
                     </VBox.margin>
                  </TextArea>
                  <TextArea fx:id="kg" editable="false" prefHeight="530.0" prefWidth="806.0" text="16. Automation Engineering&#10;&#10;Upcoming Future:&#10; Automation engineering will focus on streamlining industrial processes, smart factories, and AI-driven robotics. Technologies like IoT, robotic process automation (RPA), and AI will enhance automation systems.&#10;Career Opportunity: &#10;Automation engineers will find opportunities in manufacturing, logistics, and renewable energy. Roles like RPA specialists, control engineers, and IoT integration experts will be in demand. Certifications in PLC programming and IoT platforms will boost employability.&#10;Job Sector for the Next 10 Years: &#10;Smart factories, autonomous warehouses, and precision agriculture will create sustained demand for automation experts. Healthcare automation will also emerge as a key area.&#10;New Industries &amp; Businesses:&#10; Companies specializing in AI-powered robotics, industrial IoT solutions, and smart home automation will drive growth and innovation in this field.">
                     <font>
                        <Font size="21.0" />
                     </font>
                     <VBox.margin>
                        <Insets left="10.0" right="10.0" />
                     </VBox.margin>
                  </TextArea>
               </children>
            </VBox>
